{"nodes": [{"id": "_design_sync_notes_design_sync_pipeline", "label": "design-sync pipeline", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".design-sync/NOTES.md", "source_location": "L1", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "_design_sync_notes_synth_entry_mode", "label": "Synth-entry mode (bundle from app/components)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".design-sync/NOTES.md", "source_location": "L5", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The repo is a private React Router app with no library dist/, so the converter synthesizes its entry from cfg.srcDir; prop contracts come from source and are weaker than a library build."}, {"id": "_design_sync_notes_cfg_tsconfig_unset", "label": "Do not set cfg.tsconfig", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".design-sync/NOTES.md", "source_location": "L7", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The converter's tsconfigPathsPlugin tries the bare path before /index.tsx, so directory imports like ~/components/invoice fail in esbuild; esbuild's built-in tsconfig resolution handles ~/ correctly, and bundle.mjs must not be forked, so config is the fix."}, {"id": "_design_sync_notes_tsconfigpathsplugin", "label": "tsconfigPathsPlugin (lib/bundle.mjs)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": ".design-sync/NOTES.md", "source_location": "L7", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "_design_sync_notes_entry_flag", "label": "--entry ./dist/index.js flag", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".design-sync/NOTES.md", "source_location": "L8", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A non-existent entry path makes the walk-up find the repo package.json (PKG_DIR = repo root) and fall back to synthesizing from cfg.srcDir; without it the converter looks for node_modules/rock-fact and crashes."}, {"id": "_design_sync_notes_default_exports_module", "label": ".design-sync/default-exports.ts re-export module", "file_type": "code", "source_file": ".design-sync/NOTES.md", "source_location": "L9", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The synth entry's export * skips every default export (79 component files) and silently drops named exports defined in two files (AdditionalNote); the first validate failed [BUNDLE_EXPORT] with 70/209 components missing. New default-exported components must get a line here."}, {"id": "_design_sync_notes_window_rockfact", "label": "window.RockFact bundle global", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".design-sync/NOTES.md", "source_location": "L9", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "_design_sync_notes_folder_qualified_exports", "label": "Folder-qualified exports for colliding names", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".design-sync/NOTES.md", "source_location": "L10", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "AppHeader, InvoiceTableRow, RequestLower/UpperTable*, SettingsInvoiceSection, ReceiptIssueInvoiceSection, DeliveryAdditionalNote, SalesAdditionalNote; bare names are excluded with componentSrcMap: null."}, {"id": "_design_sync_notes_componentsrcmap", "label": "componentSrcMap pins", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".design-sync/NOTES.md", "source_location": "L11", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The converter matches components to source files by file name; repeated names (Table.tsx, InfoBox.tsx, Signature.tsx) and kebab-case shadcn files need explicit pins. data-table/ uses prefixed names so it needs none."}, {"id": "_design_sync_notes_gen_types_mjs", "label": "gen-types.mjs prop-contract generator", "file_type": "code", "source_file": ".design-sync/NOTES.md", "source_location": "L17", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "With no library .d.ts tree every contract was an [key: string]: unknown stub; the script emits declarations into .design-sync/.cache/types plus an index.d.ts barrel, dropping stubs from 217 to 36. Must run after yarn build and before the converter, or contracts silently revert to stubs."}, {"id": "_design_sync_notes_publishconfig_types", "label": "package.json publishConfig.types", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".design-sync/NOTES.md", "source_location": "L17", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "_design_sync_notes_cfg_cssentry", "label": "cfg.cssEntry (compiled root-*.css)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".design-sync/NOTES.md", "source_location": "L18", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "app/app.css is Tailwind v4 source and cannot ship raw, so cssEntry points at the app build's compiled stylesheet; the filename is content-hashed and must be updated after every yarn build (re-sync risk, L45)."}, {"id": "_design_sync_notes_cfg_extrafonts", "label": "cfg.extraFonts (Samim, Vazirmatn)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".design-sync/NOTES.md", "source_location": "L19", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Vite's compiled CSS references fonts by root-absolute /assets URLs the converter cannot map; samim-font and @fontsource-variable/vazirmatn source stylesheets use relative URLs and ship correctly."}, {"id": "_design_sync_notes_inter_removed", "label": "Inter removed from --font-sans", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".design-sync/NOTES.md", "source_location": "L20", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The theme named Inter first but the app never loaded it, so validate flagged [FONT_MISSING]; the user chose to remove it rather than ship Inter or accept the warning."}, {"id": "_design_sync_notes_ds_bundle_eperm", "label": "ds-bundle EPERM on Windows", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".design-sync/NOTES.md", "source_location": "L24", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "package-build.mjs cannot delete ds-bundle/ while a shell sits inside it; always use absolute paths and keep shells at the repo root."}, {"id": "_design_sync_notes_no_lib_forks", "label": "No converter lib forks rule", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".design-sync/NOTES.md", "source_location": "L25", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Any non-null componentSrcMap pin made source-kit.mjs skip derivation, collapsing 209 components to 22; the fix is the gen-types barrel providing the export list, not a fork. If pins collapse the count, check that gen-types.mjs ran."}, {"id": "_design_sync_notes_source_kit", "label": "lib/source-kit.mjs component derivation", "file_type": "code", "source_file": ".design-sync/NOTES.md", "source_location": "L25", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "_design_sync_notes_dtspropsfor", "label": "dtsPropsFor overrides for shadcn wrappers", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".design-sync/NOTES.md", "source_location": "L26", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "FieldLabel, SidebarInput, SidebarSeparator, SidebarTrigger take all props from another component, which the extractor drops; SidebarInput deliberately has no children. The other 32 stubs are genuinely prop-less store-driven components."}, {"id": "_design_sync_notes_export_collision", "label": "[EXPORT_COLLISION] synth-entry artifact", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".design-sync/NOTES.md", "source_location": "L27", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "_design_sync_notes_preview_format", "label": "Preview story format", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".design-sync/NOTES.md", "source_location": "L31", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "One export const per story with shared sample data above the first export (prompt examples are cut between exports); every Persian preview wraps content in dir=rtl; Table uses cardMode column, Dialog cardMode single at 720x520."}, {"id": "_design_sync_notes_destructive_button_warn", "label": "Destructive button dark-text render warn", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".design-sync/NOTES.md", "source_location": "L37", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "_design_sync_notes_design_login", "label": "/design-login upload authorization", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".design-sync/NOTES.md", "source_location": "L41", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "DesignSync had no authorization on the first sync and /design-login cannot run non-interactively; no projectId is pinned yet."}, {"id": "_design_sync_notes_compiled_css_coverage", "label": "Compiled CSS only contains used utilities", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".design-sync/NOTES.md", "source_location": "L46", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "_design_sync_notes_design_sync_pipeline", "target": "_design_sync_notes_synth_entry_mode", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".design-sync/NOTES.md", "source_location": "L5", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_design_sync_notes_cfg_tsconfig_unset", "target": "_design_sync_notes_tsconfigpathsplugin", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".design-sync/NOTES.md", "source_location": "L7", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_design_sync_notes_cfg_tsconfig_unse